              "type": "text",
              "content": "What conclusion can you draw from the information you gathered in the table? What can you and your family do to reduce this wastage of water? There are many ways to reduce wastage of water. For example, turning off taps when not in use and fixing water leakages. Recycling water and water harvesting also help in saving water."
